        "slc_8e30bc0553a741e75050c3f5c79f810a9ca977113664d57c981fd0924689edc2"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes CLI commands including init, start, install-launchd, uninstall-launchd, upgrade, version, logs (--audit/--err), doctor, and help."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ec9ec23e0b1fb679bb5705f9b9a5fe12c17002427d51c62a37defbeb7df2e047",
