        "slc_f315f0bbe54c8123010e5107bcd021deb8b0bc7a3cd439c11c25cd5de5583e81"
      ],
      "text": "Agent paths are auto-discovered at startup in three passes (well-known dirs, newest nvm node's bin, login-shell PATH) with no absolute paths in config.json; undetected agents are skipped."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_4d70ba6a4833b67b5c534f24b6c670bf0f3c1c0c507d7d1e55be5ab25eaefcc8",
