      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dc02850f1370566ef17904cdab3ff24efa76a69050faddd8046a800627f4e8bd"
      ],
      "text": "The daemon is built for unattended operation: single-instance lock, dormant retry every 60s on broken config instead of crash looping, graceful shutdown notifying chats, process-group kills on /stop, and retention sweeps of stale uploads/sessions (default 30 days)."
    },
