      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_92fe7311b8b3d7a3fedba83dcec200de748d34edf703aaa95d061fed16b2c76d"
      ],
      "text": "Documented limits: regex-based danger classification is imperfect, no body-text streaming for Codex/Pi/Gemini, Gemini lacks confirm-gate integration, photos only (no voice/files), one concurrent job per chat, 1:1 chats only, and macOS only."
    },
